        "a": "No. For a barbell and dumbbell logger, camera rep counting is a nice-to-have, not core to the loop. Serious lifters mostly want a fast, reliable log. If you later want camera reps, you can add them as a differentiator rather than building pose tracking from scratch, but do not let that feature delay the logger."
